erson","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p002:m0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"張華","kind":"person","person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p002:m0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"裴頠","kind":"person","person_id":"svm_6fh_34r","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p002:m0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"王戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p002:m0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"子房","kind":"person","person_id":"ea5_zvr_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p002:m0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"季劄","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":66,"last_line":66,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p005","text":"襲父爵，辟相國掾，曆吏部黃門郎、散騎常侍、河東太守、荊州刺史，坐遣吏修園宅，應免官，詔以贖論。遷豫州刺史，加建威將軍，受詔伐吳。戎遣參軍羅尚、劉喬領前鋒，進攻武昌，吳將楊雍、孫述、江夏太守劉朗各率眾詣戎降。戎督大軍臨江，吳牙門將孟泰以蘄春、邾二縣降。吳平，進爵安豐侯，增邑六千戶，賜絹六千匹。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p005:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"rj2_m1s_n3l","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"平吳軍事敘述逐將辨識；父為前文渾，非爵位主體新身份。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p005:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional